  "_about": "Every colour the 3D scene uses, after Sam_Comm_final.png: one plum ink for every outline, a warm yellow sky, salmon and coral walls, sage greens, and orbs in cool colours so they read against the warm city. Gold orbs are the ones Objection turns back. Zone two (the White Waste) adds an ice set, ice_*, after a polar dusk: pale blues and whites, navy ink, the expedition's reds and lamps, an aurora; its orbs are cobalt blue (the Injunction breaks blue orbs, and zone one's cyan) and ember, which read against the white; its enemies are navy with ember eyes.",
